# Curious Forager: the second way to forage is to sacrifice a Food. Bot1 casts a Heaped Harvest (a Food) with a Black Lotus, declining its
# search, so the graveyard holds only the Lotus and exiling three is not offered. The Forager's trigger is accepted, the Harvest is
# sacrificed as the cost (its own trigger declined), and the reflexive trigger, put on the stack after that, targets the Harvest just
# sacrificed, a permanent card in the graveyard, and returns it to hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Heaped Harvest
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Curious Forager
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

